# Workshop gallery, shots 9 to 11 of the shotlist of 2026-11-07 (THE STORY, the outfit rule and the series are in the header of
# 09-galerie-sanctuaire.feature; shots 7 and 8 are in 09c-galerie-chats.feature). Plan of the three Stray Dogs and Vanilla Animals
# Expanded dog shots below, then the scenarios. Cells read in SANCTUAIRE-CASES.md of NSB (2026-11-07), coats read in Mod/Patches
# (palette names), steps exist (ColonistRace, CoatSteps, StageDecor).
#
# SHOTLIST (index, name, place, hour, framing, gesture, decor, living things, outfit, what the image says)
#
#   9. workshop-9-dogs-clearing. emerald-clearing (carpet laid over with Soil first), 11h, clear, zoom 5 on (195, 152) (10 cells
#           tall, about 18 wide, a big dog about 27 px at 268 px wide), +60 ticks. Walk with treats. Nelim, straw
#           Apparel_CowboyHat dyed rgb (214, 174, 92) on long loose Roo_Royal_LongHD, hair colour rgb (56, 36, 18), denim
#           Apparel_CollarShirt dyed rgb (44, 86, 140), smile (MouthSmile, LidCheerful), carries 5 Kibble in her hands (carries
#           the item) and is forced to walk from (195, 157) to (195, 148) towards the camera, a front view, mid-stride half way
#           up the clearing as the hounds sprint ahead. Instant: she has just taken the treats out, the nine strays have caught the
#           smell. Nine Stray Dogs, one coat each (palette names read in the patches): SCGreyhound 1 chocolate sprints
#           (193, 156) to (192, 148); SCBorzoi 0 taupe sprints (197, 157) to (198, 148); SCAfghanHound 2 mist runs (199, 156)
#           to (201, 149); SCBorderCollie 0 chocolate runs back (191, 150) to (194, 155); SCBullmastiff 2 stone lies (191, 153);
#           SCCaucasianshepherd 0 slate lies (202, 155); SCChowchow 2 ink stands (200, 151) facing West; SCGoldenRetriever 2
#           taupe stands (194, 149) facing South: the animal that faces the camera; SCBullTerrier 2 grey walks at her heel
#           (196, 157) to (196, 149). Decor, a flower border round the walk: Plant_Daylily fully grown at (191, 147), (191, 152),
#           (204, 150) and (203, 155); Plant_Rose fully grown at (204, 153) and (192, 157); PlantPot_Bonsai at (191, 156);
#           Plant_YellowTallGrass fully grown at (197, 147) and (201, 147) and a scatter of eight more daylilies, four roses and three tufts across the field; TorchLamp at (204, 148) lit and at (204, 157) lit: ground
#           soil with plants all round, no bare field, two lights in frame. Says: Nelim walks the nine stray dogs of the
#           neighbourhood with a handful of treats and every one of them has come for them, nine coats.
#           Estimate 5. Subtitle: "Eleven o'clock walk: nine stray dogs, nine coats."
#
#  10. workshop-10-dogs-horseshoes (name kept, scene recomposed 2026-11-09: no horseshoe game). calm-zone (cream ground), 16h, clear, low sun, zoom 6 on (200, 189) (8 cells tall, about 14
#           wide, a small dog about 19 px at 268 px wide), +20 ticks. Garden rest. Nelim, straw Apparel_CowboyHat dyed
#           rgb (214, 174, 92) on long loose Roo_Royal_LongHD, hair colour rgb (56, 36, 18), denim Apparel_CollarShirt dyed
#           rgb (44, 86, 140), smile (MouthSmile, LidCheerful), sits on the Stool at (199, 191) (sits on the building: no job to time); instant: she rests
#           in the late sun and the nine dogs have gathered round her stool, all awake. Nine Stray Dogs, one coat
#           each, spawned close round the stool: StrayDogs_SwedishVallhund 0 slate stands (200, 190) facing West; SCWelshCorgi 2 stone stands (198, 190) facing
#           East; SCMiniatureDachshund 0 chocolate (202, 190); SCPug 1 ink stands (199, 188) facing
#           South: the animal that faces the camera; SCSchnauzer 2 coffee stands (201, 188) facing West; SCOldEnglishSheepdog 1
#           taupe stands (197, 189) facing East; SCSaintbernard 1 taupe (203, 189); SCNewFoundland 1 mist (196, 188);
#           StrayDogs_BerneseMountainDog 1 mist (200, 187). Decor, a garden court round the stool: Plant_Daylily
#           fully grown at (195, 182), (195, 191), (205, 191) and (205, 183); PlantPot_Bonsai at (205, 185); TorchLamp at (205, 188)
#           lit and at (205, 181) lit; Stool at (199, 191); SculptureSmall at (201, 191); Plant_YellowTallGrass fully grown at
#           (196, 191): low sun plus two lamps. Says: Nelim rests on a stool in the garden court and the nine dogs have gathered round her,
#           nine coats. Flag: the Newfoundland and the Bernese are near-black sprites, they are there for presence.
#           Estimate 5. Subtitle: "Four o'clock rest: nine dogs gather round Nelim's stool."
#
#  11. workshop-11-dogs-supper. prestige-hall (grey rug, table, piano), 19h, clear outside, zoom 3.5 on (196, 112) (7 cells tall,
#           about 12 wide, a pug about 19 px at 268 px wide), +30 ticks. Supper. Nelim, no hat, denim Apparel_CollarShirt dyed
#           rgb (44, 86, 140), Roo_HD_Hair_Highpony, hair colour rgb (56, 36, 18), smile (MouthSmile, LidCheerful), no Duster
#           yet (it comes in the last shot), starts at (194, 113) facing East and is forced to haul 1 MealFine to (199, 113), the dogs know
#           the way. Instant: she has just lifted the dish, the dogs trot after the smell. Five Vanilla Animals Expanded dogs, one
#           coat each: AEXP_GermanShepherd 2 slate walks (193, 114) to (198, 114); AEXP_Beagle 2 stone stands (199, 112) facing
#           West, begging; AEXP_Pug 1 ink lies (194, 111); AEXP_FrenchBulldog 2 chocolate stands (194, 109) facing South: the
#           animal that faces the camera; AEXP_WelshTerrier 0 mist walks (200, 113) to (200, 109). Decor, the supper hall: the
#           existing table, piano, rug, braziers, pots and bonsai, plus
#           Plant_Daylily fully grown at (194, 112), (199, 115) and (200, 112), TorchLamp at (193, 109) lit and at (200, 110) lit:
#           lamps in frame. Says: Nelim carries supper to a laid table and five dogs follow the smell, five coats.
#           Estimate 5. Subtitle: "Supper at seven: five dogs know the way to the table."
#
# RISK: the strays stop at their targets (+45 ticks), Play_Horseshoes may not choose its stand cell (fallback above), the emerald
# carpet may still show at the edges (lay the soil one cell wider), dark indoors at 19h (the lit torches).
